# Archmage Xylem's chain, both factions: Magecraft (8250), Magic Dust (8251),
# The Siren's Coral (8252) and Destroy Morphaz (8253).
# Levels 50-54: the Forever beta stops at 30 until launch on 4 November, so
# this guide is based on data, not play.
# Forever change (Forever's Mage class quest list,
# data/local/quest-audit/): Destroy Morphaz no longer
# offers the Arcane Crystal Pendant, Fire Ruby or Glacial Spike; Forever's
# quest data (quest 8253, checked 2026-10-14) does not name what it gives instead, so the guide names no reward. 8250-8252 are
# unchanged.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for the givers, Sanath Lim-yo,
# Archmage Xylem and the blood elves and sirens that drop the dust and coral;
# travel.json for the Azshara flight points; codex/instances.json for Morphaz as
# a boss of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar; the Sunken Temple entrance (Swamp of
# Sorrows 69.9,53.6) as forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater has it; the
# quest texts for Sanath's teleport, the cliffs and the green drake.
# Destroy Morphaz is dungeon work (the Sunken Temple, a group of five).

step Magecraft (Stormwind)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Maginor Dumas, the Master Mage, stands in the Wizard's Sanctum in Stormwind's Mage Quarter; Dink in Ironforge gives the same quest.
  level 50
  accept 8250 npc 331                         -- Maginor Dumas

step Magecraft (Orgrimmar)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Uthel'nay, one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers, gives it; so do Pierce Shackleton in the Undercity and Archmage Shymm in Thunder Bluff.
  level 50
  accept 8250 npc 7311                        -- Uthel'nay

step Sanath Lim-yo
  zone Azshara
  tip Fly to Talrendis Point (Alliance) or Valormok (Horde). Sanath Lim-yo camps below his master's tower: from the fork of Azshara's main road at the Ruins of Eldarath, head straight north to the cliffs. He teleports you up to Archmage Xylem.
  turnin 8250                                 -- Sanath Lim-yo
  accept 8251                                 -- Archmage Xylem, in the tower

step Glittering Dust
  tip The blood elves camp along the cliffs of north-eastern Azshara; Blood Elf Surveyors and Reclaimers drop the dust.
  collect 20028 quest 8251.1                  -- Glittering Dust

step Archmage Xylem
  tip Back to Sanath Lim-yo, who teleports you up to the tower.
  turnin 8251                                 -- Archmage Xylem
  accept 8252

step Enchanted Coral
  tip The Spitelash Sirens walk the ruins and beaches around the Ruins of Eldarath and the bay; they carry the coral.
  collect 20029 quest 8252.1                  -- Enchanted Coral: Spitelash Siren

step Archmage Xylem again
  tip Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower.
  turnin 8252                                 -- Archmage Xylem
  accept 8253

step Morphaz
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Morphaz, a green drake, waits deep in the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the Sunken Temple in the Pool of Tears: a group of five, level 50-54. Kill him for the Arcane Shard.
  collect 20085 quest 8253.1 @69.9,53.6       -- Arcane Shard: Morphaz

step The Arcane Shard
  zone Azshara
  tip Back to Azshara, Sanath Lim-yo and the tower.
  turnin 8253                                 -- Archmage Xylem
